  "description": "Stock popped up on the screener and has news to carry it higher…",
  "body_html": "<p>Lets be clear…there is no such thing as a “recession proof” stock. I see that term thrown around, and it sends the hair on my neck strait up! You can have some recession resistant stocks though. In a true recession, just about everything goes down, but at different times. Recession resistant stocks just go up a bit longer, while the broader market starts its descent. </p><p>That said… I built a algorithm that compiles the top stocks for each sector, normalizes the stock’s prices, averages them, and we can get a glimpse of whether those recession resistance sectors (like utilities and healthcare), are actually showing life. We can see both of them popping and pointing upwards, while sectors like Tech remain relatively flat (at least for now). Utilities are considered recession resistance because people will ultimately buy electric, water, internet, etc. Health care is considered recession resistance because people choose to pay, to not die. Duh lol! </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!apoC!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad5edcfb-2aa3-498c-8a4a-55adff6d0add_1770x912.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!apoC!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad5edcfb-2aa3-498c-8a4a-55adff6d0add_1770x912.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!apoC!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad5edcfb-2aa3-498c-8a4a-55adff6d0add_1770x912.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!apoC!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubst